{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Woohoo Melanie! I passed the adoption agency interviews last Friday! I'm so excited and thankful. This is a big move towards my goal of having a family."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-420937ee9c97570c3df77863", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.414706+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "420937ee9c97570c3df77863", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "420937ee9c97570c3df77863", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Congrats, Caroline! Adoption sounds awesome. I'm so happy for you. These figurines I bought yesterday remind me of family love. Tell me, what's your vision for the future?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-960db2c28276b5240163b91a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.445592+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "960db2c28276b5240163b91a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "960db2c28276b5240163b91a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks so much, Melanie! It's beautiful! It really brings home how much love's in families - both blood and the ones we choose. I hope to build my own family and put a roof over kids who haven't had that before. For me, adoption is a way of giving back and showing love and acceptance."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-c52630350e1047c19aa067f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.472464+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c52630350e1047c19aa067f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c52630350e1047c19aa067f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Wow, Caroline, that's awesome. Giving a home to needy kids is such a loving way to build a family. Those kids will be so supported and happy in their new home."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-52c2a23fbec8de1fe8dd4f7d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.503906+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "52c2a23fbec8de1fe8dd4f7d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "52c2a23fbec8de1fe8dd4f7d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. My dream is to create a safe and loving home for these kids. Love and acceptance should be everyone's right, and I want them to experience it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-0eb6a7b8a3615f1d8ffed986", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.526931+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0eb6a7b8a3615f1d8ffed986", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0eb6a7b8a3615f1d8ffed986", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: I totally agree, Caroline. Everyone deserves that. It's awesome to see how passionate you are about helping these kids."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-88b0fb74d5786884b9d70a24", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.546289+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "88b0fb74d5786884b9d70a24", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "88b0fb74d5786884b9d70a24", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Mel. Finding self-acceptance was a long process, but now I'm ready to offer love and support to those who need it. It's empowering to make a positive difference in someone's life."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-f3c8a1a7fda87d2fe91a1796", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.562856+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f3c8a1a7fda87d2fe91a1796", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f3c8a1a7fda87d2fe91a1796", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: That must have been tough for you, Caroline. Respect for finding acceptance and helping others with what you've been through. You're so strong and inspiring."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-4a82c5a860942d6ec0dfedce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.583277+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a82c5a860942d6ec0dfedce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a82c5a860942d6ec0dfedce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. Transitioning wasn't easy and acceptance wasn't either, but the help I got from friends, family and people I looked up to was invaluable. They boosted me through tough times and helped me find out who I really am. That's why I want to pass that same support to anyone who needs it. Bringing others comfort and helping them grow brings me such joy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-fe797e333f4575fd41f08c59", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.604356+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fe797e333f4575fd41f08c59", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fe797e333f4575fd41f08c59", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: I'm so happy for you, Caroline. You found your true self and now you're helping others. You're so inspiring!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-d6f9a35b593aa0c779f118b9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.629337+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d6f9a35b593aa0c779f118b9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d6f9a35b593aa0c779f118b9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. Your support really means a lot. This journey has been amazing and I'm grateful I get to share it and help others with theirs. It's a real gift."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-ddc1b9d020fbbf0825efe9c0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.648807+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ddc1b9d020fbbf0825efe9c0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ddc1b9d020fbbf0825efe9c0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Absolutely! I'm so glad we can always be there for each other."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-469c0dcf8756640e9f810686", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.669284+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "469c0dcf8756640e9f810686", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "469c0dcf8756640e9f810686", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Glad you agree, Caroline. Appreciate the support of those close to me. Their encouragement made me who I am."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-254244c602d35d37f29622a3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.686446+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "254244c602d35d37f29622a3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "254244c602d35d37f29622a3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Glad you had support. Being yourself is great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-3d35b78ccc4765af8206edd7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.708027+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3d35b78ccc4765af8206edd7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3d35b78ccc4765af8206edd7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Yeah, that's true! It's so freeing to just be yourself and live honestly. We can really accept who we are and be content."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-26/session_19-ababdd29884b1f3b36f4d3d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:25:55.729242+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ababdd29884b1f3b36f4d3d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ababdd29884b1f3b36f4d3d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
